cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Critical Bi-Pyramid Rigidity, Exact 42-Bit Hypergraph Stitching over the 656 (5,5;42) Catalog, and Formal Certification of M(5,5;43) <= 2"
message: "If you use this software, dataset, or Lean 4 formal certificate in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
license: MIT
authors:
