repository-code: "https://github.com/00sodj/ramsey-r55-k43"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24595135"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility suite, extremal graph datasets, and standalone Lean 4 kernel
  certificate establishing the constructive Ramsey multiplicity upper bound
  M(5,5;43) <= 2, exact automorphism and local rigidity theorems (k=22 core and
  252-million-state bounded Hamming ball) for the two canonical critical
  bi-pyramids G*_1 and G*_2, and a complete zero-truncation 42-bit hypergraph
  stitching census proving min E_{K5}^*(G_42) = 2 across all 656 non-isomorphic
  oriented (5,5;42) extremal graphs.
